# This repository is authored on Windows and only ever run on Linux, so line
# endings are pinned rather than left to core.autocrlf. A run_all.sh that
# arrives with CRLF fails as `\r: command not found`, which is a confusing way
# to lose an hour on a machine you can only reach by hand.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
